<title>USA: Integral Systems completes 3-for-1 split.</title>
<headline>Integral Systems completes 3-for-1 split.</headline>
<dateline>LANHAM, Md 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Integral Systems Inc said Tuesday it had completed the 3-for-1 stock split approved by shareholders last month.</p>
<p>The split gives every shareholder of record as of July 1, an additional two shares of the company's common stock. The company said the additional shares should be made available to shareholders in book entry form on or about July 15.</p>
<p>It said that after the stock split, the total number of its common shares outstanding will be 2,859,738, compared to 953,246 shares before the split.</p>
